  "This tab runs the complete joint strategy. Settings define all input instruments, calculations and execution legs. Start calculates on streamed or pushed observations. Place order opens one paper ticket for all execution legs; Square position closes the held legs. Prices and quantities are editable. Stop retains positions. Backtest can override input instruments without changing the live strategy; each entry uses its selected sizing policy. Apply can stop and clear the entire simulation; saved backtests remain independent.": {
    "zh-Hant": "此分頁執行完整聯合策略。設定包含所有輸入標的、計算與交易部位。啟動後以串流或推送觀測值計算。下單會開啟所有交易部位的模擬單；平倉則關閉持有部位。價格及數量可編輯。停止會保留部位。回測可更換輸入標的而不影響即時策略；每次進場使用選定的數量方式。套用可停止並清除整個模擬；已儲存回測維持獨立。"
  },
  "Futures spreads default to configured contract quantities and multipliers. Fixed quantities preserve the chosen hedge. Optional price balancing uses entry prices; signal calculations retain their configured hedge ratio.": {
    "zh-Hant": "期貨價差預設使用設定的合約數量與乘數。固定數量保留選定的避險配置。選用價格平衡會依進場價格計算；訊號仍使用設定的避險比率。"
  },
  "The entire strategy will stop, including flat instruments. Choose how to finish this run and apply the edited settings.": {
    "zh-Hant": "整個策略將停止，包括無部位標的。請選擇如何結束本次模擬並套用設定。"
  },
  "Square records closing paper trades and P/L at the latest available prices. Delete removes the entire current simulation. Previous runs and saved backtests are kept; unsaved backtests are deleted. The strategy stays stopped until you start it.": {
    "zh-Hant": "平倉會以最新可用價格記錄模擬成交與損益。刪除會移除整個目前模擬。先前執行紀錄及已儲存回測會保留；未儲存回測會刪除。策略維持停止，直到再次啟動。"
  },
